TEXT 32 640 Left 2 ;Low-side NMOS switch for an inductive load (a relay coil: L1 with its winding resistance Rcoil)\nD1 clamps the turn-off spike to Vcc + Vf; without it the drain would fly far above the MOSFET's rating
